Project Design Phase

ComicCraft-AI – Comic Story Creator Using Gemini Models

The Project Design Phase defines how the ComicCraft-AI system will be structured, how users interact with it, and how Gemini models are integrated to generate comic stories.

1. System Architecture Design

ComicCraft-AI follows a simple AI-based architecture:

User → Web Interface → Backend → Gemini AI Model → Story/Comic Generation → Output

User Interface: Allows users to enter story ideas, characters, genre, and preferred style.

Backend: Processes user input and manages communication with the Gemini API.

Gemini Model: Generates the story, characters, dialogues, scenes, and comic descriptions.

Database: Stores user projects, generated stories, characters, and comic panels.

Output Module: Displays the completed comic story in an organized panel-by-panel format.


