3. Functional Design

The major functions of ComicCraft-AI are:

Function	Description

Story Generation	Creates a complete story from the user's idea
Character Creation	Generates character names, personalities and descriptions
Scene Generation	Divides the story into different comic scenes
Dialogue Generation	Creates suitable dialogues for characters
Panel Generation	Organizes scenes into comic panels
Story Editing	Allows users to modify generated content
Save Project	Stores comic projects for future use
Export	Provides the final comic in a usable format


4. Gemini AI Integration

Gemini models are used as the main AI component. The user's prompt is converted into a structured request and sent to the Gemini model.

Example:

> User Input: "Create a superhero story about a college student who discovers a mysterious power."



The Gemini model can generate:

Title

Story summary

Characters

Character personalities

Scenes

Dialogues

Narration

Comic panel descriptions


