7. Design Goals

The design of ComicCraft-AI focuses on:

Simple and user-friendly interface

Fast AI-based story generation

Creative and customizable comic stories

Consistent characters and scenes

Easy editing and regeneration

Secure storage of user projects

Easy export and sharing


8. Proposed Technology Stack

Component	Technology

Frontend	HTML, CSS, JavaScript / React
Backend	Python / Node.js
AI Model	Google Gemini Models
Database	Firebase / MongoDB / MySQL
API	Gemini API
Hosting	Firebase / Vercel / Cloud platform


9. Overall Design

ComicCraft-AI is designed as an AI-powered comic creation platform where users provide a simple idea and the system transforms it into a structured comic story. Gemini models handle the creative generation, while the application manages user input, project data, editing, preview, and export.
